	(text "GPIO plan (ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8R2, quad PSRAM: IO35-37 are free)\nEach side of the module serves the motors on that side, in connector order:\nIO4/5 ENC1_B/A   IO6/7 M1_IN1/2   IO15/16 M2_IN2/1   IO17/18 ENC2_A/B\nIO35/36 ENC3_B/A   IO37/38 M3_IN1/2   IO39/40 M4_IN2/1   IO41/42 ENC4_A/B\nIO8/IO9  I2C SDA/SCL (Arduino defaults)     IO10  MOT_EN    IO21  MOT_FAULT\nIO11/12  servos    IO43/44  UART0 lidar    IO47  buzzer    IO48  RGB LED\nJ12 pins: P1 = IO1, P2 = IO2 (both ADC1), P3 = IO13, P4 = IO14    IO3  VBAT_SENSE (ADC1_CH2)\nIO19/20 native USB, IO0 BOOT. IO45/IO46 are strapping pins: left unconnected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "03657c02-4e6f-43b2-8471-8af544929d74")
	)
	(text "NO PSRAM\n=> ordinary IO"
